x tiles away from the TzHaar-Ket. \n\nAll TzHaar have an uncommon chance to drop [[uncut sapphire]]s, [[uncut emerald]]s, and [[uncut ruby|uncut rubies]] as well as a rare chance to drop [[uncut diamond]]s. The drop rates listed below for materials ([[gems]] and [[Onyx bolt tips]]) increase by 33% when wearing a charged [[ring of wealth]].\n\nThere are stronger TzHaar-Ket located in the [[Mor Ul Rek#Inner Area|inner area of the city]] which drop pieces of the [[obsidian armour set]]. In order to access these, a [[fire cape]] must be shown at the barrier to the inner city.\n\nIt is possible to safespot the TzHaar-Ket by standing behind [[sulphur vent|sulphur vents]] found within [[Mor Ul Rek]]. While fighting a TzHaar-Ket, players can go into the [[Fight Caves]] and die to fully heal themselves and recharge [[Prayer]].\n\n==Locations==\n{{LocTableHead}}\n{{LocLine\n|name = TzHaar-Ket\n|location = [[Mor Ul Rek]]\n|levels = 149\n|members = yes\n|mapID = 23\n|plane = 0\n|x:2439,y:5133|x:2443,y:5145|x:2447,y:5143|x:2452,y:5151|x:2457,y:5129|x:2459,y:5161|x:2464,y:5162|x:2467,y:5142|x:2472,y:5166|x:2473,y:5147|x:2479,y:5168|x:2482,y:5154|x:2482,y:5159|x:2487,y:5138|x:2491,y:5173|x:2439,y:5113|x:2448,y:5111|x:2451,y:5117|x:2456,y:5105|x:2457,y:5117|x:2460,y:5108|x:2461,y:5104|x:2464,y:5099|x:2466,y:5097|x:2476,y:5087|x:2478,y:5111|x:2480,y:5084|x:2484,y:5104|x:2486,y:5081|x:2486,y:5083|x:2490,y:5076|x:2497,y:5143|x:2501,y:5142|x:2506,y:5168|x:2511,y:5136|x:2513,y:5134|x:2516,y:5125|x:2517,y:5158|x:2519,y:5128|x:2522,y:5131|x:2526,y:5152|x:2527,y:5142|x:2541,y:5122|x:2502,y:5082|x:2505,y:5102|x:2514,y:5107|x:2517,y:5085|x:2519,y:5116|x:2527,y:5091|x:2533,y:5105|x:2534,y:5113|x:2536,y:5101|x:2445,y:5169|x:2535,y:5111|x:2538,y:5110|x:2436,y:5122|x:2450,y:5121|x:2457,y:5121|x:2492,y:5173|x:2492,y:5176|x:2493,y:5156|x:2493,y:5159\n|mtype = pin\n|version=Level 149\n|dropversion=Level 149\n|leagueRegion = Karamja\n}}\n{{LocLine\n|name = TzHaar-Ket\n|location = [[Mor Ul Rek]]\n|le